## 📌 Featured Projects

### 🔹 SRAM Controller ASIC Design
Complete RTL-to-GDSII ASIC implementation with timing closure and DRC clean design using Cadence Innovus & Genus.

### 🔹 ChipTop ASIC Physical Design
Full ASIC Physical Design flow including Floorplanning, Macro Placement, CTS, Routing, and Timing Analysis using Cadence Innovus.

### 🔹 FIFO ASIC Physical Design
RTL-to-GDSII implementation with Placement & Routing optimization and timing analysis.

### 🔹 ALU16 PPA Optimization (OpenLane)
16-bit ALU implementation using OpenLane Sky130 with PPA optimization.

